# Environment templates moved next to the code that reads them:
#
#   apps/api/.env.example   API + seed (dev: copy to apps/api/.env;
#                           prod: copy to deploy/api.env)
#   apps/web/.env.example   Vite build-time variables (VITE_*)
#   deploy/.env.example     docker-compose.prod.yml: domain, image tag,
#                           Postgres container credentials (copy to deploy/.env)
#
# NEVER commit a real .env, api.env or deploy/.env.
